e="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 K.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 K.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr><tr class="borderBottom "><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Rear setback (lot), minimum</div></td><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">5 feet</div></td><td align="center" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="3" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 L.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 L.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr><tr class="borderBottom "><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Rear setback (alley), minimum</div></td><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">3 feet</div></td><td align="center" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="3" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Rear setback (street), minimum</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">20 feet</div></td><td align="center" class="entry" startcol="3" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable " style="border-color:"><table class=" frame frameNone"><colgroup><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 94%"></col></colgroup><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" colspan="2" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">NOTES:</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">•</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Parking shall be accessed from rear alleys or side streets whenever possible.</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem breakHere" id="33431115"><a alt="375-402(2)(f)(iv)" class="litem_number" href="33431115#33431115" onclick="return false;" title="375-402(2)(f)(iv)">(iv) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Frontage elements.</div><div class="codeTable " style="border-color:"><table class=" frame frameNone"><colgroup><col style="width: 100%"></col></colgroup><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="center" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2hiv.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2hiv.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameTopBottom" style="border-color:black; " tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 41%"></col><col style="width: 36%"></col><col style="width: 23%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry borderBottom" colspan="3" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:#ffffff;background-color:#c0c0c0;border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Frontage Elements</b></div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Allowed frontage elements</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Porch, terrace or light well, forecourt, stoop, shopfront</div></td><td align="center" class="entry" startcol="3" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 M.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 M.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameNone" style="border-color:black; " tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 94%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry" colspan="2" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:black;background-color:white;border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">NOTES:</div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">•</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Frontage elements may encroach forward of the build-to zone and/or into the right-of-way, barring any additional restrictions by the public entity that has control over the public right-of-way.</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">•</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">See § <a class="xref" guid="33430959" href="33430959#33430959">375-402(1)</a> (General standards) for requirements of frontage elements.</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameNone" style="border-color:black; " tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 94%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry" colspan="2" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:#ffffff;background-color:#c0c0c0;border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Miscellaneous Notes</b></div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">•</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">All buildings must have a primary pedestrian entrance along the front facade.</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="33431116"><a alt="375-402(2)(g)" class="litem_number" href="33431116#33431116" onclick="return false;" title="375-402(2)(g)">(g) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Connected edge frontage standards.</div><div class="level"><div class="litem breakHere" id="33431117"><a alt="375-402(2)(g)(i)" class="litem_number" href="33431117#33431117" onclick="return false;" title="375-402(2)(g)(i)">(i) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Building height.</div><div class="codeTable " style="border-color:"><table class=" frame frameNone"><colgroup><col style="width: 100%"></col></colgroup><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="center" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2gi.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2gi.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameTopBottom" style="border-color:black; " tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 41%"></col><col style="width: 36%"></col><col style="width: 23%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry borderBottom" colspan="3" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:#ffffff;background-color:#c0c0c0;border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Building Heights</b></div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class="borderBottom "><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="middle"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Building height, minimum</div></td><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="middle"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">1 story</div></td><td align="center" class="entry borderBottom" rowspan="2" startcol="3" style="border-color:black;" valign="middle"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 A.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 A.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="middle"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Building height, maximum</div></td><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="middle"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">2.5 stories</div></td></tr><tr class="borderBottom "><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">First story height, minimum</div></td><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">10 feet</div></td><td align="center" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="3" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 B.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 B.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Ground finished floor above sidewalk or finished grade (residential)</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">24 inches</div></td><td align="center" class="entry" startcol="3" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 C.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/AL0934-375 C.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameNone" style="border-color:black; " tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 94%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry" colspan="2" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:black;background-color:white;border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">NOTES:</div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">•</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Towers, cupolas, and other rooftop features with a footprint smaller than 20 feet by 20 feet may extend up to 30 feet above the designated height limit.</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem breakHere" id="33431118"><a alt="375-402(2)(g)(ii)" class="litem_number" href="33431118#33431118" onclick="return false;" title="375-402(2)(g)(ii)">(ii) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Building placement.</div><div class="codeTable " style="border-color:"><table class=" frame frameNone"><colgroup><col style="width: 100%"></col></colgroup><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="center" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2gii.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2gii.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameTopBottom" style="border-color:black; " tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 41%"></col><col style="width: 36%"></col><col style="width: 23%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry borderBottom" colspan="3" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:#ffffff;background-color:#c0c0c0;border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Building Placement</b></div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class="borderBottom "><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Front build-to zone</div></td><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Contextual<sup class="superscript">[1]</sup></div></td>