:0px;">•</div></td><td align="left" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">All buildings must have a primary pedestrian entrance along the front facade.</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem breakHere" id="33431121"><a alt="375-402(2)(h)" class="litem_number" href="33431121#33431121" onclick="return false;" title="375-402(2)(h)">(h) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Waterfront edge frontage standards.</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="33431122"><a alt="375-402(2)(h)(i)" class="litem_number" href="33431122#33431122" onclick="return false;" title="375-402(2)(h)(i)">(i) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Building height.</div><div class="codeTable " style="border-color:"><table class=" frame frameNone"><colgroup><col style="width: 100%"></col></colgroup><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="center" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><span class="graphic"><a href="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2hi.tif.png" id="" target="_blank"><img class="graphicThumb&#xA; " src="/attachment/336787/375-4 B2hi.tif.SM.png"></img></a></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameTopBottom" style="border-color:black; " tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 41%"></col><col style="width: 36%"></col><col style="width: 23%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry borderBottom" colspan="3" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:#ffffff;background-color:#c0c0c0;border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Building Heights</b></div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class="borderBottom "><td align="left" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="